# This project currently has no secrets, so this file is intentionally
# empty of real entries. It exists as a committed template so a future
# secret has a documented place to be declared without ever committing
# its actual value.
#
# When a genuine secret is needed — a form service ID, an analytics write
# key, an API token — add its name here with a placeholder value, then set
# the real value in your local, untracked .env file. Example shape:
#
# FORM_SERVICE_ID=
# ANALYTICS_WRITE_KEY=
#
# Public, non-secret values (site name, domain, social links, certification
# and publication URLs, the CV path) do not belong here — they live in
# src/config/site.ts instead.
